<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>

  <!--
    What a colony talks about (Source/ColonyCouncil/Social/Talk/). Each colonist holds a view on each topic, from against
    (-1) to for (+1). The first time it's needed, the view starts from their character (seed: per side of them, the view
    at a side of 100, in hundredths), their traits, passions and faith (leans), a small personal lean (spread) and what
    their life now adds (the worker's experience: a vendetta, their trust in the council, last night's meal). After that
    it drifts a little each day toward what their life suggests, and moves through talk.

    relevance: how much it comes up next to the others (the worker says when it can't). hotDays: how long news on it
    stays hot. interest: who brings it up (per side, in hundredths). perSubject: a view per person it's about.
    viewFor / viewAgainst: the view in words, for the character page. Leans name traits (with their degree), passions,
    memes and precepts by defName; anything a DLC or mod doesn't bring is skipped.
  -->

